  "system": {
    "identifier": "chasing-fang",
    "description": "<p>You first launch a fist full of throwing weapons towards a target to break their focus. Make a ranged taijutsu attack. On a hit, you deal your thrown [Weapons damage] + 2d10, which is then follow up with a Powerful Swing.</p>\n<p>Then move into a space within range, adjacent to the original target creature. Make a melee taijutsu attack, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 2d10.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: Creatures hit by the ranged attack must make a Constitution saving throw, having their guard broken, reducing their DR by 6 until the end of the current turn.</p>\n<p>Chain 3: Creatures hit by the melee attack must make a Constitution saving throw, being Staggered on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above A-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d10.</p>",
